har="." align="char">3.2</td><td char="." align="char"/><td char="." align="char">2,134</td><td char="." align="char">7.2</td><td char="." align="char"/><td char="." align="char">4,206</td><td char="." align="char">14.2</td><td char="." align="char"/></tr><tr><td colspan="15">Location of rescue/recovery work<sup>f</sup></td></tr><tr><td>Worked at WTC on pile</td><td char="." align="char">12,494</td><td char="." align="char">40.9</td><td char="." align="char">9,966</td><td char="." align="char">79.8</td><td char="." align="char">0.0001</td><td char="." align="char">510</td><td char="." align="char">4.1</td><td char="." align="char">0.0001</td><td char="." align="char">815</td><td char="." align="char">6.7</td><td char="." align="char">0.0041</td><td char="." align="char">1,805</td><td char="." align="char">14.8</td><td>0.0001</td></tr><tr><td>Worked at WTC in another area</td><td char="." align="char">17,115</td><td char="." align="char">56.0</td><td char="." align="char">10,583</td><td char="." align="char">61.8</td><td char="." align="char"/><td char="." align="char">437</td><td char="." align="char">2.6</td><td char="." align="char"/><td char="." align="char">1,264</td><td char="." align="char">7.6</td><td char="." align="char"/><td char="." align="char">2,329</td><td char="." align="char">14.1</td><td char="." align="char"/></tr><tr><td>Worked at Staten Island recovery operations</td><td char="." align="char">828</td><td char="." align="char">2.7</td><td char="." align="char">412</td><td char="." align="char">49.8</td><td char="." align="char"/><td char="." align="char">20</td><td char="." align="char">2.4</td><td char="." align="char"/><td char="." align="char">43</td><td char="." align="char">5.3</td><td char="." align="char"/><td char="." align="char">57</td><td char="." align="char">7.0</td><td char="." align="char"/></tr><tr><td>Worked on a transport barge</td><td char="." align="char">80</td><td char="." align="char">0.3</td><td char="." align="char">51</td