urned by interview</td><td char="." align="char">6,836</td><td char="." align="char">55.8</td><td char="." align="char">4,478</td><td char="." align="char">65.5</td><td char="." align="char">0.0026</td><td char="." align="char">184</td><td char="." align="char">2.7</td><td char="." align="char">0.0065</td><td char="." align="char">575</td><td char="." align="char">8.6</td><td char="." align="char">0.0004</td><td char="." align="char">987</td><td char="." align="char">15.1</td><td>0.0005</td></tr><tr><td>Yes, did not return by interview</td><td char="." align="char">622</td><td char="." align="char">5.1</td><td char="." align="char">392</td><td char="." align="char">63.0</td><td char="." align="char"/><td char="." align="char">14</td><td char="." align="char">2.3</td><td char="." align="char"/><td char="." align="char">67</td><td char="." align="char">10.9</td><td char="." align="char"/><td char="." align="char">126</td><td char="." align="char">21.1</td><td char="." align="char"/></tr><tr><td>Did not evacuate home</td><td char="." align="char">4,804</td><td char="." align="char">39.2</td><td char="." align="char">3,272</td><td char="." align="char">68.1</td><td char="." align="char"/><td char="." align="char">174</td><td char="." align="char">3.7</td><td char="." align="char"/><td char="." align="char">488</td><td char="." align="char">10.8</td><td char="." align="char"/><td char="." align="char">660</td><td char="." align="char">15.2</td><td char="." align="char"/></tr><tr><td colspan="15">Period when residential evacuees returned home<sup>h</sup></td></tr><tr><td>September 11&#x02013;13, 2001</td><td char="." align="char">594</td><td char="." align="char">8.8</td><td char="." align="char">431</td><td char="." align="char">72.6</td><td char="." align="char">0.0001</td><td char="." align="char">21</td><td char="." align="char">3.6</td><td char="." align="char">0.0184<sup>j</sup></td><td char="." align="char">80</td><td char="." align="char">13.9</td><td char="." ali